<title>USA: Brandywine Realty completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Brandywine Realty completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>NEWTOWN SQUARE, Pa. 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brandywine Realty Trust said Friday it has completed its acquisition of a portfolio of nine properties in suburban Philadelphia for about $30.3 million.</p>
<p>The purchase price includes $26.5 million in preferred shares, convertible under certain circumstances, into up to 1.606 million common shares.</p>
<p>It acquired the properties from the Pennsylvania State Employees Retirement System.</p>
<p>Brandywine Realty is a real estate investment trust.</p>
</text>
